op=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ecbbcf8ef2370526c3f80b36b6de1cf 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I really fell in love with your style!\n\nI'd like to request two silly best friends who are mecha pilots in training. They often wear matching outfits and are totally into oshikatsu.\n\n🧶 GEN (190 cm)\nOre-sama type personality. A cocky gym rat who's secretly good at housework. The newest recruit at the military base, who puts on airs aroudn his friends.\n※ いつも笑顔。左眉の下と左頬にほくろがある。\n\nテーマ: 山々、松の木、氷山、金継ぎ、ミントアイスクリーム、魚、ロケット、星座、夜空、白椿\n\n⚛️ ZEZE (152 cm)\nKuudere-type personality. A coolheaded gamer girl, raised by the government since childhood. An experienced and infamous mecha pilot.\n※ 無表情。白いまつ毛。\n\nテーマ: 磁石、蛍、稲妻、鶴、サボテン、三目並べ、テレビゲーム、金継ぎ、骸骨、アイスクリーム、朝顔\n\nWe really love the atmospheric lighting, coloring, and expressions in your illustrations! A scene where Gen is carrying Zeze on his back up some stairs, where they're at a concert waving fans and penlights, where they're racing each other through the streets, or where they're silly and casual with each other over a dinner table or with merch would be really cute.\n\nPlease draw freely! Alternative clothing OK! Thank you for your consideration ♡\n\nhttps://zippy-stealer-c43.notion.site/Gen-Zeze-2e117861336c81749540d85e6e99c81e", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@8s4_q/works/42", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/eaed29fe/uploads/outputs/3afdf913-87e1-46b7-b506-8225c03670f2?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b76311499a2c539f0ed07a2b5a32f0dd", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/eaed29fe/uploads/outputs/3afdf913-87e1-46b7-b506-8225c03670f2?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b76311499a2c539f0ed07a2b5a32f0dd, https://si.imgix.net/eaed29fe/uploads/outputs/3